<title>BELGIUM: Brussels 1996 air cargo export destinations.</title>
<headline>Brussels 1996 air cargo export destinations.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 cargo figures for the top 10 international destinations from Brussels airport in thousands of metric tonnes.</p>
<p>			  1996	1995	1996 vs 1995</p>
<p> New York	     53,062    61,867    down 14.23pct</p>
<p> Hong Kong	    19,048    20,744    down  8.17</p>
<p> Bahrain		13,532    13,037    up    3.80</p>
<p> Riyadh		 13,003    16,441    down 20.91</p>
<p> Chicago		12,952    17,151    down 24.48</p>
<p> Singapore	    12,339    15,562    down 20.71</p>
<p> Jeddah		 11,753    10,980    up    7.04</p>
<p> Tel Aviv		6,079     6,173    down  1.52</p>
<p> Dayton		  6,040     -----	    ----</p>
<p> Dhahran		 4,383     5,691    down 22.99</p>
<p>-- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
